@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

rectangle "호스트 (브라우저 또는 Node)\n영속성, 물리적 정지, 페일세이프 담당" as Host
rectangle "station.mjs / policy.mjs\n공유 펌프 경계, 제약 템플릿" as Station
rectangle "control-runtime.mjs\n가상 출력, 센서 엔진,\n입력 타입 검사, 추적에 품질 기록" as Control
rectangle "ghostflow-runtime.mjs\n원시 ABI용 무의존성 래퍼" as Wrapper
rectangle "ghostflow-wasm cdylib (C ABI)\nESP-IDF와 같은 ghostflow-core" as Wasm
rectangle ".gfb + 신뢰된 .manifest.json" as Artifact

Host --> Station
Host --> Control
Control --> Wrapper
Wrapper --> Wasm : gf_alloc, .gfb 복사,\nexport 호출
Artifact --> Control
@enduml
